              rdfs:label "lc:inheritsFrom" .


###  https://w3id.org/laborchain#labeledBy
:labeledBy rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
           rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topObjectProperty ;
           rdfs:domain :TrainingDataset ;
