           rdfs:label "lc:labeledBy" .


###  https://w3id.org/laborchain#operatesIn
:operatesIn rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
            rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topObjectProperty ;
            rdfs:domain :LaborUnit ;
